WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.977 --> 00:00:13.677
scratched her head.

2
00:00:13.697 --> 00:00:16.580
"If you didn't open the portal, who did?"

3
00:00:17.341 --> 00:00:18.922
Zark pressed buttons on a device.

4
00:00:19.823 --> 00:00:20.863
"I have no idea.

5
00:00:20.883 --> 00:00:23.886
Our trackers can't seem to find—" Voop!

6
00:00:24.627 --> 00:00:25.667
Another portal opened.

7
00:00:27.729 --> 00:00:30.832
A figure stepped out, wearing thick armor and a spiky helmet.

8
00:00:31.744 --> 00:00:32.824
A visor covered its face.

9
00:00:32.844 --> 00:00:35.285
"Are you Rocket Girl?"

10
00:00:35.725 --> 00:00:36.485
the figure asked.

11
00:00:38.846 --> 00:00:39.966
Roxy raised an eyebrow.

12
00:00:39.986 --> 00:00:42.387
"Yeah. Who are you?"

13
00:00:43.227 --> 00:00:44.348
The creature stepped closer.

14
00:00:44.368 --> 00:00:48.089
"I'm the Battle Master."

15
00:00:49.149 --> 00:00:49.869
Roxy frowned.

16
00:00:49.889 --> 00:00:56.451
"Did you open that She felt an invisible force squeeze her.

17
00:00:56.471 --> 00:00:58.912
"Hey! What's going on?"

18
00:00:59.948 --> 00:01:04.291
The Battle Master stepped aside, and the invisible force dragged Roxy through the portal.

19
00:01:06.793 --> 00:01:07.634
The figure followed.

20
00:01:13.038 --> 00:01:14.459
Roxy struggled to free herself.

21
00:01:14.479 --> 00:01:16.661
"Who do you think you are?"

22
00:01:17.802 --> 00:01:19.123
Suddenly everything grew dark.

23
00:01:19.824 --> 00:01:22.906
Roxy felt the force let go of her, and she charged forward.

24
00:01:23.406 --> 00:01:25.288
Bonk! She hit a wall.

25
00:01:25.832 --> 00:01:30.153
Dim lights turned on, and Roxy realized she was in a clear, floating cube.

26
00:01:30.673 --> 00:01:32.074
The Battle Master was gone.

27
00:01:32.094 --> 00:01:33.754
"Rocket Girl!"

28
00:01:34.615 --> 00:01:35.575
Roxy spun around.

29
00:01:36.435 --> 00:01:38.196
Cozlin was in a floating cube too.

30
00:01:39.316 --> 00:01:41.817
Their cubes floated in a vast, open space.

31
00:01:41.837 --> 00:01:43.757
"Where are we?"

32
00:01:44.157 --> 00:01:44.857
Roxy asked.

33
00:01:45.518 --> 00:01:47.958
"I don't know, but I'm not staying here!"

34
00:01:48.778 --> 00:01:49.859
Cozlin punched a wall.

35
00:01:49.879 --> 00:01:52.419
"Ouch." She shook out her hand.

36
00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:56.080
Whiz-hoo! Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

37
00:01:56.681 --> 00:01:57.821
Ping! Ping!

38
00:01:58.501 --> 00:02:00.422
The laser beams bounced all over the cube.

39
00:02:00.442 --> 00:02:04.623
"Ahh!" Roxy ducked and jumped to avoid them.

40
00:02:05.943 --> 00:02:07.363
Then she stared at the wall.

41
00:02:07.964 --> 00:02:09.944
Orange beams radiated from her eyes.

42
00:02:10.744 --> 00:02:12.205
The air in the cube heated up.

43
00:02:12.225 --> 00:02:16.526
"Yikes!" Roxy blew her freeze breath to cool it down.

44
00:02:17.406 --> 00:02:19.427
Cozlin ran and threw herself against a wall.

45
00:02:20.027 --> 00:02:21.127
Roxy stomped her foot.

46
00:02:21.927 --> 00:02:23.808
She pounded on the wall, but it didn't break.

47
00:02:26.344 --> 00:02:26.784
"This isn't working!"

48
00:02:26.804 --> 00:02:27.884
Roxy sat down and sighed.

49
00:02:28.685 --> 00:02:31.986
"How will we get out of Hey, wait!

50
00:02:32.506 --> 00:02:33.986
You can walk through walls!"

51
00:02:34.866 --> 00:02:35.887
Cozlin shook her head.

52
00:02:35.907 --> 00:02:38.367
"I tried that before you got here.

53
00:02:38.907 --> 00:02:39.928
It didn't work either.

54
00:02:40.388 --> 00:02:41.928
I tried calling Delkor too.

55
00:02:41.948 --> 00:02:43.589
I can't get a connection."

56
00:02:44.549 --> 00:02:47.550
Roar! They looked down and gasped.

57
00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:51.331
The dragon was in a large cube below them.

58
00:02:52.451 --> 00:02:55.892
The cube shook as the dragon clawed at the walls surrounding it.

59
00:02:56.672 --> 00:02:57.513
Cozlin chuckled.

60
00:02:57.533 --> 00:03:02.196
"At least we're not stuck in a cube with that dragon!"

61
00:03:02.976 --> 00:03:03.817
Roxy frowned.

62
00:03:03.837 --> 00:03:05.958
"How can you laugh right now?

63
00:03:06.339 --> 00:03:07.599
This is all your fault!"

64
00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:09.941
"It's the dragon's fault!"

65
00:03:10.261 --> 00:03:11.042
Cozlin said.

66
00:03:11.062 --> 00:03:15.505
"It tried to destroy—" "You're the one who let the dragon out!"

67
00:03:15.905 --> 00:03:16.646
Roxy cried.

68
00:03:16.666 --> 00:03:19.628
"Just because you wanted some stupid gold!"

69
00:03:20.208 --> 00:03:21.529
Cozlin folded her arms.

70
00:03:21.549 --> 00:03:24.351
"Look, I said I was sorry."

71
00:03:25.131 --> 00:03:26.032
Roxy gasped.

72
00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:27.380
"No, you didn't!"

73
00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:29.501
Cozlin scratched her head.

74
00:03:29.521 --> 00:03:30.501
"I didn't?"

75
00:03:31.281 --> 00:03:32.062
Roxy groaned.

76
00:03:32.082 --> 00:03:36.463
"I can't believe this is happening."

77
00:03:37.203 --> 00:03:39.203
Just then bright light shined down on them.

78
00:03:39.984 --> 00:03:41.044
The cubes rose.

79
00:03:42.284 --> 00:03:43.805
Now Roxy saw other cubes.

80
00:03:44.385 --> 00:03:45.605
Each one held a prisoner.

81
00:03:46.205 --> 00:03:47.766
A lot of the prisoners looked pretty tough.

82
00:03:48.726 --> 00:03:51.547
The roar of a crowd grew louder as the cubes rose higher.

83
00:03:55.588 --> 00:03:56.188
Roxy said.

84
00:03:57.056 --> 00:03:58.957
They were now in an enormous arena.

85
00:03:59.978 --> 00:04:02.860
The stands were filled with all sorts of cheering aliens.

86
00:04:07.143 --> 00:04:09.925
"Welcome to the Stadium of the Stars!"

87
00:04:10.745 --> 00:04:14.788
The Battle Master appeared on a floating platform, and his voice thundered through the arena.

88
00:04:16.189 --> 00:04:18.150
"I am the Battle Master.

89
00:04:19.031 --> 00:04:26.676
And this is the galaxy's greatest competition—the Galactic Battle Bonanza!"
